 "equipment_type": "BACnet gateway for power meters (WattsOn)",
 "applies_to": "Elkor ETBAC gateway serving one or more Elkor WattsOn power meters as BACnet objects.",
 "summary": "The ETBAC object map shows how the gateway presents each connected WattsOn power meter: a block of read-only Analog Inputs per meter with ratios, serial number, totals, per-phase voltage, current, power, power factor and energy. One Analog Value sets the polling delay. Meter 1 uses instances 100128-100852, meter 2 the same offsets from 200000.",
 "bacnet_transport": [],
 "firmware": null,
 "default_device_instance": null,
 "access_inferred": true,
 "notes": [
  "Only meter 1 (instances 100xxx) is listed here. The map prints meter 2 with the same objects at 200xxx, so meter N is N x 100000 plus the same offset (an inferred pattern beyond meter 2).",
  "Object names carry the meter number (DEVICE-1/..., DEVICE-2/...).",
  "The map has no access column. All objects are listed as read-only; AV 1 (polling delay) may be writable on site.",
  "The device object in the example map is B6130-1486516 (instance 1486516); that is a sample instance, not a default.",
  "The two-page map does not state the transport, network settings or firmware.",
  "Power factor, ratios, serial number and software version carry no units."
 ],
